  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Project Preparation Capacity in Asia and the Pacific (Cluster TA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed cluster regional capacity development technical assistance (TA) will contribute to achieving the overall AP3F objective by providing upstream assistance to DMCs,

essentially increasing their capacity to prepare and undertake PPPs and developing the enabling environment for PPPs. The TA will help DMCs address the project preparation gap by supporting a range of activities in DMCs to lay the groundwork (such as legislative and policy reform) necessary for DMCs to be able to tap the AP3F for further assistance in structuring their projects.</narrative>
  </description>
